  "about": "Innovative IT leader with 20+ years of experience building and optimizing technology solutions that keep manufacturing, supply chain, and enterprise operations running efficiently. Known for turning complex business needs into simple, intuitive systems that boost productivity, visibility, and continuous improvement. A hands on problem solver and collaborative mentor, passionate about empowering teams through automation and data-driven decision-making.\n\nSpecialties:\n\nCloudInventory Mobile Enterprise Platform (formerly DSI) / JD Edwards EnterpriseOne Integration Specialist with 15+ years of experience designing, deploying, and managing mobile enterprise and ERP-connected inventory solutions. Skilled at integrating shop floor and warehouse operations with enterprise systems to deliver real time visibility, automate material flows, and ensure accurate tracking of serialized, lot controlled, and high value items. Proven track record in optimizing plant execution, reducing manual processes, and driving digital transformation across manufacturing and distribution environments\n\nApplication Developer (VBA, SQL, Microsoft Access) focused on Supply Planning and MRP systems. Builds tools that simplify scheduling, improve material accuracy, and enhance operational efficiency. Recognized for analytical thinking, creative technical design, and a strong grasp of real world manufacturing workflows.\n\nQuickBase Administrator & Developer experienced in designing and maintaining custom business apps that connect teams and streamline complex workflows. Expert in transforming processes into scalable, user friendly solutions that improve visibility, automate tasks, and drive smarter decisions. Proficient in data modeling, pipelines, integrations, and dashboards with a focus on performance and user experience.\n\nSQL Developer & Database Administrator skilled in designing, optimizing, and maintaining high performance data systems. Experienced in building complex queries, stored procedures, and ETL processes for reporting, forecasting, and BI. Strong background in database design, performance tuning, and data integrity across SQL Server and enterprise systems.\n\nCore Skills:\nQuickBase App Development • BI & Analytics • Process Automation • ERP Integrations • SQL & Database Design • Dashboards & Data Visualization • End-User Training • Cloud Solutions",
